d zoom can return an image that is geometrically correct but linguistically wrong. Adding the language field repairs that collision while leaving style-version collisions unresolved. We enumerate pairs of requests that should share an output and pairs that must remain distinct, using those relations as tests of the key function. The analysis also separates semantic equality from byte equality because compression may vary without changing the rendered content. The principal result is a reproducible method for deriving a cache key from declared dependencies rather than appending fields only after individual stale-output bugs appear.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"academic-ja-0016","collection":"dataset/academic/ja.jsonl","text":"斜光を受ける凹凸面の明暗境界\n細かい溝を持つ模型表面へ、角度を変えて白色光を当てた。撮影の露出を固定すると、照射角が浅いほど溝の境界は明瞭になったが、深い部分の情報は黒くつぶれた。自動露出を使った画像では全体の明るさが補正され、この関係が見えにくくなった。溝の向きと光の向きのなす角を変えると、同じ高さ差でも境界のコントラストが異なる。提案した測度は明るい領域と暗い領域の比率を使うため、反射率が場所ごとに違う面にはそのまま適用できない。模型画像の比較を通じ、画像の見やすさと高さの推定精度が同じ指標ではないことを確認した。模型の寸法や照明設定の範囲を越える普遍的な最適角は示していない。","token_ids":[7741,250,6708,231,30512,5877,245,76622,30369,12870,117,12870,116,28190,16144,31958,88399,245,43244,225,98220,198,27869,108,32149,16995,36117,251,30512,69978,59739,54872,25287,21405,28190,2243,116,5486,64936,27479,30512,8192,231,58942,38144,23706,121,39135,6708,231,30512,40265,38144,28713,1811,58843,106,58322,16144,52597,110,20834,30512,9921,118,23187,54926,19732,5486,163,92871,16175,226,64936,29295,27699,227,16995,2243,119,67645,36117,251,16144,43244,225,98220,15682,31958,163,252,255,20230,26854,42891,28713,29295,5486,85315,109,16995,34048,17620,16144,40474,78943,15682,30868,240,47884,59739,2243,114,33121,28713,1811,37026,91875,52597,110,20834,30512,33655,42891,28713,55723,66201,77181,37087,33014,16144,31958,30369,30813,29295,70892,250,37656,84389,5486,51330,97518,11743,224,29295,91774,58942,20230,47884,47884,26854,42891,28713,1811,36117,251,16144,70141,50834,19732,6708,231,16144,701