","ní"," z","á","chr","ann","é"," slu","ž","by"," (","V","Z","S",")"," Nov","é"," M","l","ý","ny",".\n","J","ed","n","alo"," se"," o"," neh","odu"," motor","ov","é","ho"," č","l","unu",","," kter","ý"," u"," hr","á","ze"," pr","vn","í","ho"," je","z","era"," nov","om","l","ý","ns","k","ých"," n","á","dr","ž","í"," pou","ž","ív","aj","í"," prac","ov","ní","ci"," o","db","orn","é"," fir","my"," ke"," ge","olog","ick","é","mu"," pr","ů","zk","umu"," stav","by"," r","ych","lost","ní"," kom","unik","ace"," R","52","."," P","ř","es"," ok","ra","je"," k","ov","ov","é","ho"," č","l","unu"," o"," ro","zm","ě","re","ch"," z","hr","uba"," ","7"," kr","át"," ","2"," met","ry",","," uv","á","zan","é","ho"," u"," pont","on","u"," ge","od","et","ů",","," se"," v"," n","oci"," v"," sil","n","ém"," v","ě","tru"," za","č","aly"," př","el","é","vat"," v","ys","ok","é"," v","ln","y"," a"," po"," nap","ln","ě","ní"," pl","avid","la"," v","od","ou"," se"," č","l","un"," pot","op","il","."," Z"," motor","u"," č","l","unu"," do"," je","z","era"," un","ik","lo"," mal","é"," m","no","ž","st","v","í"," rop","n","ých"," lá","tek",","," kter","é"," na"," h","lad","in","ě"," v","yt","vo","ř","ily"," sk","vr","nu"," o"," ro","zm","ě","re","ch"," z","hr","uba"," jed","no","ho"," č","t","vere","č","ní","ho"," met","ru","."," O"," ud","á","lost","i"," has","ič","i"," inform","oval","i"," prac","ov","ní","ky"," o","db","oru"," ž","ivot","ní","ho"," prost","ř","ed","í"," M","ě","st","sk","é","ho"," ú","ř","ad","u"," v"," Mik","ul","ov","ě",","," �","�","esk","é"," ins","pek","ce"," ž","ivot","ní","ho"," prost","ř","ed","í"," a"," P","ov","od","í"," Mor","avy","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"K úniku ropných látek na vodní plochu dnes hasiči vyjížděli na vodní dílo Nové Mlýny na Břeclavsku.\nHlášení o události krajské operační a informační středisko HZS přijalo v 7.29 hodin, na místě postupně zasahovaly dvě jednotky hasičů ze stanic v Mikulově a Břeclavi. Spolu s hasiči zasahovali také členové Vodní záchranné služby (VZS) Nové Mlýny.\nJednalo se o nehodu motorového člunu, který u hráze prvního jezera novomlýnských nádrží používají pracovníci odborné firmy ke geologickému průzkumu stavby rychlostní komunikace R52. Přes okraje kovového člunu o rozměrech zhruba 7 krát 2 metry, uvázaného u pontonu geodetů, se v noci v silném větru začaly přelévat vysoké vlny a po naplnění plavidla vodou se člun potopil. Z motoru člunu do jezera uniklo malé množství ropných látek, které na hladině vytvořily skvrnu o rozměrech zhruba jednoho čtverečního metru. O události hasiči informovali pracovníky odboru životního prostředí Městského úřadu v Mikulově, České inspekce životního prostředí a Povodí Moravy.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-cs-0071","collection":"dataset/fineweb/cs.jsonl","text":"Právě předvánoční kriminalita v obchodních centrech a v jejich okolí je totiž fenoménem, který se každý rok odráží v policejních statistkách. Prosinec je v nich zapsán jako měsíc se zvýšeným počtem útoků zlodějů na majetek zákazníků, připomíná Ladislav Beránek z ředitelství pražské policie.\nV hlavním městě bude dvoutýdenní infomační kampaň završena ve čtvrtek. „Odpoledne od 15 hodin budeme oslovovat zákazníky v Albertu v nákupním centru na Chodově,\" řekla Deníku preventistka Zuzana Pidrmanová. Zkušenost pražských policistů přitom napovídá, že samotní obyvatelé metropole patří k těm opatrnějším. Obětí zlodějů, kteří se před svátky do metropole stahují zblízka i z daleka, se totiž skoro častěji než domácí stávají návštěvníci města – ať už mimopražští, nebo cizinci. Prostě lidé, které zlákaly předvánoční nákupy, doprovodný program, ale i vánočně vyzdobené centrum. I tamější trhy totiž vedle návštěvníků s počestnými úmysly vábí nejrůznější nenechavce. A třebaže policisté posilují služby nejen uniformovaných mužů a žen zákona, ale i kriminalistů včetně takzvaného „kapsa týmu\", ohlídat všechny nekalé živly prostě není možné.","token_ids":[3617,1995,85,22161,59406,291,85,1995,2201,13453,55122,597,58140,6388,348,1536,331,347,55122,331,12541,331,264,348,64064,718,5509,337,2483,4864,2458,72,12453,44585,316,10610,336,11,100228,20195,513,16909,12453,67,20195,938,74,297,3696,1995,12453,2483,348,4379,73,55122,331,20719,74,54161,13,32134,483,66,4864,348,58971,1167,2690,11644,50826,296,22161,82,30515,513,1167,85,20195,11906,268,20195,76,3273,13453,880,18448,30694,52353,1167,83582,22161,73,52353,4415,24906,295,1247,1167,72542,1394,55122,74,52353,11,59406,575,316,25196,1995,70130,23265,402,9084,1995,48045,1167,27006,247,3671,301,267,85,2483,45103,12453,4991,978,8708,648,627,53,50686,31697,56094,296,22161,267,22161,293,799,33876,412,20195,67,2734,2483,4225,7942,13453,55122,597,23465,129,230,1167,70684,11906,7304,5320,33902,83,19456,43813,13,15179,67408,5481,839,818,11018,220,868,87903,258,37808,3981,2709,36247,869,266,1167,72542,1394,55122,8050,348,17971,84,348,308,72542,455,55122,76,2960,2739,4415,921,347,869,22161,1359,27006,247,1247,4355,9973,2483,12407,5471,380,4657,1901,5308,3444,393,307,81,1543,869,1995,13,1901,12407,11906,268,537,45103,12453,4991,98955,8708,380,52353,59406,275,316,26944,869,87120,1995,11,85874,10167,354,55122,1536,88,50813,301,978,2322,897,1286,3352,29432,2483,597,259,22161,76,1200,266,36722,22161,73,11906,56094,13,4761,22161,83,2483,1167,83582,22161,73,52353,11,597,668,29432,2483,513,59406,291,13871,1995,6375,88,656,2322,897,1286,357,1494,9832,2483,1167,2067,2483,89,4657,602,1167,294,1604,4657,11,513,2458,72,12453,1940,18812,33902,561,22161,7910,841,12453,4824,30441,2483,357,1995,85,1662,2483,308,1995,85,85578,22161,29238,2483,5979,296,22161,21127,1389,264,75901,577,12453,28003,454,969,12453,85578,2483,11,841,754,272,450,49697,13,1322,267,22161,27431,978,11,100228,978,1167,75,72542,5893,59406,291,85,1995,2201,13453,55122,308,72542,58598,11,27420,40494,347,77,20195,2068,11,22180,602,58397,2201,13453,77,22161,348,18854,521