re"," kø","ns","bal","anc","en"," på"," Wikipedia","?\n","V","il"," du"," også"," g","øre"," en"," v","igt","ig"," forsk","el"," for"," kvinder",","," som"," fort","j","ener"," at"," bl","ive"," hus","ket","?\n","Kom"," med"," til"," ALT",".dk"," store"," sk","rive","event"," den"," ","9","."," m","arts",","," hvor"," vi"," i"," f","æ","l","less","k","ab"," sk","river"," så"," mange"," art","ik","ler"," om"," bet","y","dn","ings","ful","de"," kvinder"," som"," mul","igt",".\n","Event","et"," af","hold","es"," i"," sam","ar","be","j","de"," med"," Wikipedia"," og"," Kv","info"," og"," bl","iver"," start","sk","udd","et"," til"," et"," ambit","i","ø","st"," må","l"," for"," ","201","9",","," hvor"," vi"," vil"," gener","ere"," ","1",".","000"," art","ik","ler"," om"," danske"," kvinder","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Nye tal fra Wikipedia Danmark viser, at blot 17 procent af de i alt 70.000 artikler på det online opslagsværk omhandler kvinder. Det vil sige, at hver gang én kvinde bliver omtalt, findes der fire artikler om mænd.\nDet vil ALT.dk gerne lave om på med kampagnen #flerekvinderpåwiki, og derfor opfordrer vi dig, kære læser, til at hjælpe os med at oprette artikler om de kvinder, hvis historie fortjener at blive fortalt.\nDer er rigtig mange oversete hunkøn, men ved du ikke helt, hvor du skal starte, har vi her samlet seks store navne, som vi undrer os over ikke allerede findes på det digitale opslagsværk.\nVil du være med til at ændre kønsbalancen på Wikipedia?\nVil du også gøre en vigtig forskel for kvinder, som fortjener at blive husket?\nKom med til ALT.dk store skriveevent den 9. marts, hvor vi i fællesskab skriver så mange artikler om betydningsfulde kvinder som muligt.\nEventet afholdes i samarbejde med Wikipedia og Kvinfo og bliver startskuddet til et ambitiøst mål for 2019, hvor vi vil generere 1.000 artikler om danske kvinder.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-de-0041","collection":"dataset/fineweb/de.jsonl","text":"Die Initiative im Dorf beginnt nicht mit dem Wunsch nach möglichst vielen Veranstaltungen. Zunächst fragen die Beteiligten, wo bereits Menschen zusammenkommen und wer diese Treffen bisher organisiert. Im Kalender stehen Feste und Vorträge, aber die regelmäßige Arbeit dazwischen ist kaum sichtbar.\nFür den ersten Versuch soll eine bestehende Sprechstunde einen leichter erreichbaren Raum erhalten. Ob das genügt, wird nicht nur anhand der Besucherzahl beurteilt. Die Gruppe möchte auch erfahren, warum Interessierte nicht kommen konnten und wie viel zusätzliche Arbeit beim Organisationsteam entsteht. Es gibt noch keinen bewilligten Ausbauplan. Beim nächsten Treffen werden zunächst die Rückmeldungen zum neuen Raum besprochen. Ein kleinerer Anfang ist nicht automatisch die bessere Lösung; er ist hier vor allem eine Möglichkeit, Annahmen zu prüfen, bevor sie sich in festen Zuständigkeiten und langfristigen Versprechen verbergen.","token_ids":[18674,38756,737,25225,69,3240,406,8969,5568,2486,468,81891,14375,51937,267,69142,93710,3223,11856,13,1901,359,94075,8508,268,2815,426,7870,74376,2002,11,24670,48243,43886,54483,43889,2073,7205,27867,12758,26734,97142,2942,88581,13,2417,27930,1693,65957,435,18223,2073,650,371,81,71768,11,19649,2815,1239,24037,70047,7404,58903,294,1394,86,18211,6127,100125,274,4970,2308,627,81693,3453,49258,25187,1412,23410,10021,1888,2701,11178,328,62331,267,29965,15826,73035,261,2781,41434,65,9329,96702,59084,13,4761,6754,4173,2448,5289,11,15165,8969,12500,459,10888,2761,18569,74712,47828,387,324,668,3036,13,8574,2895,59598,67416,11168,96502,11,4208,372,5783,434,66261,8969,59165,16947,43569,2073,13672,37177,39258,60738,20603,58903,29889,47843,47690,1218,5455,427,13,9419,28398,18268,81013,28054,484,343,2002,20602,4749,455,10946,13,2893,318,92035,12758,26734,12931,99275,94075,2815,76174,37701,11856,16419,48769,96702,9234,782,7674,13,18560,25271,10670,261,155