"," �","�","ρ","ό","ε","δ","ρ","ο","ς"," τ","η","ς"," Sony"," Music"," Entertainment","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"«Ο George Michael ήταν ένας καλλιτέχνης με μία ιστορία που αξίζει να μοιραστεί παγκόσμια στη μεγάλη οθόνη. Τιμώντας τα γενέθλιά του τον Ιούνιο, είμαστε ενθουσιασμένοι που συνεργαζόμαστε με τον David Austin και τους συνεργάτες, προκειμένου να παρουσιάσουμε αυτή τη σπουδαία ζωή και να δώσουμε πρόσβαση στους θαυμαστές ενός καλλιτέχνη που έγραψε ιστορία, εντός και εκτός σκηνής» δήλωσε ο Πρόεδρος της Sony Music Entertainment.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-en-0018","collection":"dataset/fineweb/en.jsonl","text":"Today's walking-club log\nRoute: the canal path to the disused lock and back\nWeather: bright at the start, then a slow arrival of drizzle\n\nWe divided into two groups at the footbridge because several people wanted time to sketch the old pumping house. There was no competition to finish first. Those who walked ahead left a chalk arrow at the agreed turning point, and the rest of us caught up beside the lock keeper's cottage.\nMy notebook contains fewer distances than expected. I wrote down the pattern of reeds beside a drain, the sound of a loose board, and a disagreement about whether a distant chimney belonged to the mill or the bakery. By the return journey, everyone had adopted a different theory. We ended at the covered market, where somebody produced a thermos and somebody else discovered that an apparently waterproof map was not waterproof at all. Next week we will bring a larger map case and leave more time for the pumping house.","token_ids":[15724,596,11689,12,20453,1515,198,5004,25,279,40021,1853,311,279,834,2656,5409,323,1203,198,30081,25,10107,520,279,1212,11,1243,264,6435,19163,315,1377,44237,271,1687,18255,1139,1403,5315,520,279,4579,14024,1606,3892,1274,4934,892,311,26610,279,2362,53226,3838,13,2684