e67656d656e74","20666f72","206578706c61696e696e67","2077686174","2061","206368616e6765","206d65616e73","207768656e","206974","206f6363757273","2e"],"decoded_tokens":["Before"," a"," small"," renovation"," begins",","," we"," make"," a"," shared"," sequence"," of"," work"," visible"," to"," everyone"," involved","."," The"," painter"," does"," not"," need"," a"," complete"," account"," of"," the"," electric","ian","'s"," tools",","," but"," does"," need"," to"," know"," when"," a"," wall"," will"," be"," ready","."," The"," owner"," should"," not"," have"," to"," infer"," that"," sequence"," from"," several"," unrelated"," telephone"," calls",".\n","Our"," project"," office"," keeps"," one"," current"," schedule"," with"," a"," named"," contact"," for"," each"," stage","."," Changes"," are"," recorded"," with"," their"," practical"," effect",":"," which"," visit"," moves",","," which"," room"," remains"," unavailable",","," and"," who"," needs"," to"," hear"," about"," it","."," This"," does"," not"," remove"," every"," surprise"," from"," an"," older"," building","."," It"," does"," make"," surprises"," easier"," to"," distinguish"," from"," information"," that"," somebody"," forgot"," to"," pass"," along","."," We"," also"," identify"," pauses"," during"," which"," no"," work"," is"," planned",","," so"," that"," an"," empty"," room"," is"," not"," automatically"," mistaken"," for"," an"," abandoned"," job","."," A"," reliable"," plan"," is"," less"," like"," a"," prediction"," that"," nothing"," will"," change"," and"," more"," like"," an"," arrangement"," for"," explaining"," what"," a"," change"," means"," when"," it"," occurs","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Before a small renovation begins, we make a shared sequence of work visible to everyone involved. The painter does not need a complete account of the electrician's tools, but does need to know when a wall will be ready. The owner should not have to infer that sequence from several unrelated telephone calls.\nOur project office keeps one current schedule with a named contact for each stage. Changes are recorded with their practical effect: which visit moves, which room remains unavailable, and who needs to hear about it. This does not remove every surprise from an older building. It does make surprises easier to distinguish from information that somebody forgot to pass along. We also identify pauses during which no work is planned, so that an empty room is not automatically mistaken for an abandoned job. A reliable plan is less like a prediction that nothing will change and more like an arrangement for explaining what a change means when it occurs.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-eo-0071","collection":"dataset/fineweb/eo.jsonl","text":"Vi devas plu batali por ĝui vian sukceson.\n- Instigo estas la brulaĵo por la cerbo\n- Studado estas la plej granda ribela ago kontraŭ la sistemo. Scio rompas la katenojn de sklaveco\n- Transformu \"Mi ne povas\" en \"Mi faras\" kaj vi havos ĉion, kion vi volas.\nInstigaj frazoj por lernantoj de elementa lernejo\n- Post du horoj da studado, mi ne povas ne kalkuli kiom da folioj restas al mi.\n- La facilan parton, kiun mi faris, la malfacilan parton, kiun mi faras ... kaj la maleblan parton, mi prenos ĝin, sed mi sukcesos!\n- Kun peno kaj persistemo vi povas atingi vian celon\n- Donu al ĉiu tago la ŝancon esti la plej bona en via vivo\n- Ne diru, ke vi ne havas sufiĉe da tempo. Vi havas precize la saman nombron da horoj kiel Teresa de Calcutta, Albert Einstein, Leonardo Da Vinci, Thomas Jefferson aŭ Mikelanĝelo.\n- Sukceso venas kiam viaj revoj estas pli grandaj ol viaj ekskuzoj\n- Rigardu ĝin alie hodiaŭ, estas via tago!\n- Bonaj aferoj okazas al tiuj, kiuj atendas ilin.","token_ids":[36644,3567,300,628,84,293,4306,72,4247,10044,251,2005,348,1122,96890,1634,263,627,12,6112,7992,48591,1208,1437,5724,128,113,7