t":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-fj-0063","collection":"dataset/fineweb/fj.jsonl","text":"Ena gauna a daramaka kina na nona i vava ni qito, na i lakolako qo i Ositerelia e vunitaki toka kina e dua na i tuvatuva. O ira na nona i tokani dauqito era sotava na dredre ena nodra vakavakarau kina sotasota ni Wellington Sevens ena vula tarava.\nIa, ena nona lesu mai ki Viti, e kidacalataka o Serevi ni qai mai kila ka ratou sega ni bau vakaraitaka mada vua, na i lawalawa vakailesilesi era sa digitaka oti tu na timi me na la’ki qito ki Wellington. Na kena ca, ni sa mani veivosakitaki oti tu me na vakatarogi ena retio yaloyalo ena vuku ni kena veitalanoataki na kacivaki ni yaca.\nOqo saraga nai tekitekivu ni dua na delana levu e sotava ena nona dauniveivakatavulici ena vuku ni kena sega ni rogoci na veika e laveta cake mai vei ira na tiko ena vale kau vulavula ena gauna oya.\nE vola nai vola, ena nona gauna taucoko ni qito e dau qarauna sara o Serevi me kakua ni vakayalolailaitaka e dua ena kena rogoci na nona itukutuku.","token_ids":[1737,64,13819,8733,264,294,640,13637,597,2259,4415,2536,64,602,348,2979,13080,2874,6491,11,4415,602,94786,337,29886,2874,78,602,15796,2058,37029,384,348,3928,14966,311,4657,597,2259,384,97921,4415,602,9964,85,36409,6723,13,507,6348,64,4415,2536,64,602,9825,5676,89380,80,6491,11639,274,354,2979,4415,91462,265,665,64,16387,969,75925,402,587,277,2933,597,2259,274,54624,6217,13080,57104,1369,21778,665,64,348,5724,12460,2979,627,40,64,11,665,64,2536,64,3625,84,17154,20548,650,12583,11,384,10585,582,278,61224,297,328,486,10176,13080,2874,2192,17154,597,10746,16909,11494,283,4915,64,13080,293,2933,75925,277,1339,13637,296,2649,348,4381,11,4415,602,2383,278,14406,348,13637,3742,3742,72,11639,829,16099,13637,297,10462,9964,4415,6935,72,757,4415,1208,529,6780,2874,6491,20548,57104,13,13106,597,7304,2211,11,13080,829,893,72,5320,25204,98501,14966,297,10462,9964,757,4415,75925,6526,64977,665,64,2160,822,379,278,2303,12812,665,64,348,36834,13080