la"," ca",";"," ka","'u"," a"," seg","a"," ni"," k","ila"," ni"," kem","uni"," a"," tu"," e"," na"," sala"," me"," tar","ovi"," au",":"," ia"," o","q","o",","," ke","v","aka"," sa"," ca"," ve","i"," kem","uni",","," ka","'u"," na"," les","u"," tale","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"28A sa sereka na gusu ni asa ko Jiova, ka sa vosa kina na asa vei Pelami, ka kaya A cava ka'u sa cakava vei iko, ko sa yaviti au vakatolu kina? 29A sa kaya vua na asa ko Pelami, Ni ko sa vakalialiai au: ke dua mada nai seleiwau e ligaqu, au sa qai vakamatei iko. 30A sa kaya vei Pelami na asa, Oi au na nomu asa se segai, ka ko sa dauvodoki au e na nomu bula taucoko ka yacova na siga oqo; au a daukitaka beka vakaoqo vei iko? A sa kaya ko koya, E segai. 31A sa qai vakamataraitaki Pelami ko Jiova, a sa kunea ko koya, ni sa tu e na sala na agilose i Jiova, a sa taura tu e ligana na nonai seleiwau: a sa cuva vakatoboicu. 32A sa kaya vua ko koya na agilose i Jiova, A cava ko sa yavita vakatolu kina na nomu asa? raica, ka'u a lako mai me'u tataro, ni sa lako vakatani na nomu i valavala vei au: 33a sa kunei au na asa, ka gole tani kina vakatolu vei au: kevaka sa sega ni gole tani vei au, ka'u sa vakamatei iko oti vakaidina, ka vakabulai koya, 34A sa kaya vua na agilose i Jiova ko Pelami, Au sai valavala ca; ka'u a sega ni kila ni kemuni a tu e na sala me tarovi au: ia oqo, kevaka sa ca vei kemuni, ka'u na lesu tale.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-fr-0032","collection":"dataset/fineweb/fr.jsonl","text":"Le carnet de dépenses ne m’a pas dit immédiatement où réduire mes achats. Il m’a d’abord montré que j’avais rangé des choses très différentes dans la même catégorie. Une réparation nécessaire voisinait avec un objet acheté par curiosité, et le total ne permettait pas de comprendre ce mélange.\nJ’ai repris les lignes sans chercher à leur attribuer un jugement moral. Sur une copie du tableau, j’ai ajouté le motif de chaque achat et la date à laquelle j’avais décidé de le faire. Deux sommes voisines retrouvaient ainsi des histoires très différentes. Certaines dépenses resteront difficiles à prévoir ; le carnet ne doit pas faire semblant de supprimer cette incertitude. Pour le mois suivant, je veux surtout distinguer les montants déjà engagés de ceux qui ne sont encore que des estimations. Le tableau sera moins compact, mais je pourrai voir ce que je sais vraiment au moment de prendre une décision, au lieu de l’apprendre seulement après coup.","token_ids":[2356,1841,4816,409,87885,4377,841,296,40753,6502,22011,4998,978,8747,5722,39723,9517,1072,556,11083,34361,1900,13,7695,296,40753,294,529,370,541,1647,376,978,1744,503,57892,2852,43200,978,951,79165,25945,96642,7010,1208,27584,8415,97193,13,39783,9517,36235,100243,4160,58504,1339,9952,653,31260,34361,295,978,1370,2917,3614,13109,11,1880,514,2860,841,29557,83,1339,6502,409,60946,265,3846,296,19010,853,627,41,50808,31736,285,3625,72700,288,15878,23008,9211,3869,28130,17780,8977,653,23200,1133,16033,13,8242,6316,6293,648,3930,57234,11,503,50808,90096,978,514,60612,409,46777,264,9884,1880,1208,2457,3869,1208,88265,503,57892,2852,7591,21200,978,409,514,20028,13,1611,2249,74533,100164,1572,38831,283,6723,1188,44351,951,77617,3946,25945,96642,13,35211,288,87885,4377,2800,261,546,61907,3742,3869,27389,35573,2652,514,1841,4816,841,42182,6502,20028,80664,519,409,1043,48670,20662,3709,531,3993,13,27058,514,46415,46932,519,11,4864,5320,2249,76776,1612,287,8977,3625,20605,1821,46939,2995,351,5512,409,66056,7930,841,15132,35597,1744,951,15279,811,13,2009,57234,35737,40970,17251,11,10071,4864,5019,68962,46131,3846,1744,4864,63762,60019,8065,4545,409,59394,6316,35881,1854,11,8065,39381,409,326,82175,9484,265,71686,42138,16081,13],"tokens":["4c65","20636172","6e6574","206465","2064c3a970","656e736573","206e65","206d","e2809961","20706173","20646974","20696d6d","c3a9","6469","6174656d656e74","206fc3b9