ar bailithe le chéile le tabhairt faoi cheolchoirm a dhéanfaí a thaifeadadh. Bheadh orthu ceithre amhrán déag a chumadh is a chleachtadh don ócáid agus Lindsay-Hogg ann le gach rud a thaifeadadh. Get Back an teideal a bhí ar an tionscnamh ach is Let it Be a baisteadh ar an albam agus an clár teilifíse. Cuireadh clabhsúr ar an tionscnamh leis an gceolchoirm cháiliúil siúd ar bharr foirgnimh ar Saville Row; ba í an cheolchoirm dheiridh acu í mar bhanna.","token_ids":[1305,978,318,71,325,523,6258,72,25155,613,13081,37646,41236,91708,602,829,337,459,44089,12930,3091,74913,374,66842,59801,321,374,4046,458,309,71,436,5038,71,13,350,773,1036,459,523,978,329,409,718,308,1832,318,396,308,1832,3678,7589,264,971,318,265,802,264,308,7561,380,686,733,7748,2483,7589,26,602,329,945,311,82,6792,1097,613,274,3458,7591,12748,25774,66826,11,459,523,1995,321,35196,316,71,10018,11,3846,337,264,523,21581,4415,58725,4171,52676,945,3824,5104,64,945,355,29038,1995,41967,6885,514,293,1995,258,2483,13,435,3524,72,220,5162,24,44089,2483,1028,1036,300,514,1437,589,384,6526,339,84,11,459,18922,94332,309,71,945,490,1995,339,945,355,602,329,25487,83856,3453,27894,273,52668,13,31930,2483,459,293,12930,802,264,35196,978,409,404,307,71,627,40,77426,469,276,1995,404,4415,60389,3444,7589,44089,2483,347,277,25487,83856,514,523,978,458,514,5769,51729,83,2267,6870,3091,337,971,2923,264,35196,978,276,3716,2483,264,49588,1643,329,52687,13,426,2025,71,30299,84,3846,411,265,1097,4171,11644,7591,351,264,523,372,52687,374,264,523,273,16317,52687,1541,41967,66,1995,307,945,355,63884,11529,16499,3008,514,342,613,68330,264,49588,1643,329,52687,13,2175,6984,459,1028,64053,264,44089,2483,802,459,259,919,66,12682,71,34361,374,6914,433,2893,264,13081,380,3228,71,802,459,453,81667,945,355,459,1206,42354,78514,333,2483,325,13,27560,556,52687,1206,370,5104,6792,81,802,459,259,919,66,12682,71,514,285,459,342,346,337,971,2923,523,1995,4008,6792,321,4502,6792,67,802,44089,1138,12018,404,5010,318,71,802,20680,4618,11035,26,1