rafouyen ekselan, anviwònman estrès fann rezistans tou trè eksepsyonèl.\n4, bon rezistans korozyon chimik: tiyo HDPE ka kenbe tèt ak korozyon yon varyete de medya chimik, prezans pwodwi chimik nan tè a pa pral lakòz okenn degradasyon nan tiyo a. Polietilèn se yon izolan elektrik, kidonk li pap pouri, rouye oswa korozyon elektwochimik; Li tou pa ankouraje kwasans lan nan alg, bakteri oswa fongis.\n5, rezistans aje, lavi sèvis long: tiyo PE ki gen 2-2.5% distribisyon inifòm nan nwa kabòn ka estoke deyò oswa itilize pou 50 ane, yo pa pral domaje nan radyasyon iltravyolèt.\n6, mete rezistans: rezistans nan mete nan tiyo HDPE ak tès konparezon tiyo asye montre ke rezistans nan mete nan tiyo HDPE se 4 fwa sa yo ki an tiyo asye. Nan transpò labou, HDPE tiyo ofri pi bon rezistans mete konpare ak tiyo asye, ki vle di pi long lavi sèvis ak pi bon ekonomi.","token_ids":[45,276,16947,30972,2857,26039,513,52719,282,65699,11,9165,16417,264,7251,550,278,23975,587,17774,22980,89,7970,49158,380,598,665,72089,20622,5634,727,4558,75,1208,627,18,11,7970,49158,380,598,30607,12416,282,1036,25,12445,1777,4173,15878,581,69178,20548,13081,9279,11,282,22980,82,259,61055,4915,2159,4558,17774,49158,380,598,59400,283,77251,90762,77200,11,459,10176,86,22980,77,1543,30607,12416,282,1036,49158,380,598,15119,490,4558,27955,325,1725,26039,4558,75,627,19,11,7970,49158,380,598,597,18812,4341,263,38094,1609,25,9165,16417,12445,1777,16909,50332,1395,259,4558,83,17774,597,18812,4341,263,379,263,13592,7870,409,1812,7911,38094,1609,11,81042,598,27679,347,17043,38094,1609,20622,259,4558,264,7251,550,278,94786,22980,89,5509,2734,409,6902,6539,263,20622,9165,16417,264,13,3735,3978,321,4558,77,513,379,263,22924,38872,63888,376,1609,11,10585,263,74,908,26365,5019,72,11,29465,9188,297,2332,64,597,18812,4341,263,10732,5964,1146,331,318,1609,26,14851,15119,7251,71572,414,11305,597,16514,598,31791,20622,17797,11,37303,466,72,297,2332,64,282,647,285,627,20,11,49158,380,598,264,3841,11,326,6321,274,4558,2749,1317,25,