" met","e"," nan"," ti","yo"," HD","PE"," se"," ","4"," f","wa"," sa"," yo"," ki"," an"," ti","yo"," as","ye","."," Nan"," trans","p","ò"," lab","ou",","," HD","PE"," ti","yo"," of","ri"," pi"," bon"," rez","ist","ans"," met","e"," kon","pare"," ak"," ti","yo"," as","ye",","," ki"," v","le"," di"," pi"," long"," l","avi"," s","è","vis"," ak"," pi"," bon"," ek","onom","i","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Nan konstriksyon sezon fredi, tiyo a pa pral krak akòz bon rezistans enpak nan materyèl la.\n3, bon rezistans estrès fann: HDPE gen sansiblite ki ba dan, fòs taye segondè ak rezistans grafouyen ekselan, anviwònman estrès fann rezistans tou trè eksepsyonèl.\n4, bon rezistans korozyon chimik: tiyo HDPE ka kenbe tèt ak korozyon yon varyete de medya chimik, prezans pwodwi chimik nan tè a pa pral lakòz okenn degradasyon nan tiyo a. Polietilèn se yon izolan elektrik, kidonk li pap pouri, rouye oswa korozyon elektwochimik; Li tou pa ankouraje kwasans lan nan alg, bakteri oswa fongis.\n5, rezistans aje, lavi sèvis long: tiyo PE ki gen 2-2.5% distribisyon inifòm nan nwa kabòn ka estoke deyò oswa itilize pou 50 ane, yo pa pral domaje nan radyasyon iltravyolèt.\n6, mete rezistans: rezistans nan mete nan tiyo HDPE ak tès konparezon tiyo asye montre ke rezistans nan mete nan tiyo HDPE se 4 fwa sa yo ki an tiyo asye. Nan transpò labou, HDPE tiyo ofri pi bon rezistans mete konpare ak tiyo asye, ki vle di pi long lavi sèvis ak pi bon ekonomi.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-hu-0040","collection":"dataset/fineweb/hu.jsonl","text":"A fiú minden hazatéréskor ugyanoda tette a kulcsát, kivéve azon az estén, amikor egy dobozt is cipelt. Másnap az egész lakást átkutatta, de a dobozt gondosan kikerülte, mert azt még nem tekintette a rendetlenség részének. A kulcs végül a tetejére hajtott kendő alatt volt.\nAmikor felemelte a kendőt, eszébe jutott, hányszor ment el a doboz mellett anélkül, hogy belenézett volna. Az új tárgyat még nem számította a lakáshoz, ezért keresés közben is kikerülte. A megtalált kulcs után nem rendet rak az egész életében. Csak leül, kibontja a dobozt, és előveszi belőle a lámpát, amelyért előző nap elment. A lámpa fénye gyenge, de éppen a bejárat melletti tálra esik. Oda helyezi a kulcsot. A változás kicsi marad, és nem kell biztosnak lennünk benne, hogy másnap is emlékezni fog rá.","token_ids":[32,9314,6792,91644,20750,266,68862,4991,269,577,4680,276,14320,259,6672,264,75516,4942,17099,11,597,344,978,588,12657,263,12657,1826,10610,11,1097,1609,269,31808,656,754,11949,374,272,575,3903,13,84975,7004,12657,8866,78979,94786,56503,19216,6375,332,33019,11,409,264,656,754,11949,342,2159,437,276,597,25840,36624,668,11,296,531,98994,83791,24566,43185,396,6672,264,17634,295,75,729,19395,31807,89,978,48045,13,362,75516,4942,348,19395,36624,264,259,7870,73,978,265,305,1662,83,1751,72848,17221,453,1617,16798,627,6219,1609,269,1172,3516,301,668,264,72848,17221,83,11,1560,89,978,1395,503,332,1751,11,305,11644,73445,269,11540,658,264,656,754,89,10804,28163,459,19010,74,36624,11,33506,1689,268,978,89,7211,4499,3458,13,15757,18448,73,80684,2026,99715,83791,24566,10244,36334,16485,22983,264,94786,1995,939,9700,11,44420,87453,597,13213,5512,68924,8123,374,597,25840,36624,668,13,362,757,5289,278,98720,75516,4942,8791,11644,24566,17634,295,84044,12657,8866,78979,4046,1169,978,8123,13,68432,587,514,36624,11,597,581,546,5697,264,656,754,11949,11,22257,89911,2396,8510,1689,17221,273,264,54738,1331,17099,11,1097,989,87453,89911,86827,26944,658,479,13,362,54738,1331,64,58482,3919,68,29720,6443,11,409,4046,604,268,264,387,73,1995,18071,10804,1169,10462,259,19540,969,1560,1609,13,507,3315,91215,68,8510,264,75516,4942,354,13,362,87080,998,89,7206,597,1233,72,3678,329,11,22257,24566,79172,43478,43681,43974,2479,77,97407,3399,818,11,33506,11158,7004,374,991,69328,441,89,7907,31349,49769,13],"tokens":["41","206669","c3ba","206d696