 poi alla riparazione improvvisata. Il gettone finì in una scatola con le fotografie del vecchio spazio. Non come cimelio importante, ma come piccolo promemoria. Sul nuovo inventario il leggio fu descritto con una riga semplice: completo, funzionante, da verificare soltanto dopo averlo appoggiato.","token_ids":[54133,5048,3900,34264,385,1030,15587,59033,12391,11676,25160,680,277,708,653,2531,46245,390,5203,342,43008,23605,23100,64,13,67063,10462,781,31050,541,402,5770,1798,58209,11,86496,16711,829,375,6723,62055,49490,325,49253,11357,4428,13,7695,13510,5683,461,1624,34670,5481,30714,1891,2700,62028,4669,390,29032,67268,12881,4008,304,1338,8934,370,4008,13,44071,63137,9265,523,82153,1891,463,959,385,36413,26858,40216,15377,73829,13,445,24439,3900,2531,46245,43524,2979,64514,11,7643,304,34437,21797,78,13,328,36726,1208,2385,11639,31230,54485,3709,980,4428,653,7638,53501,636,59029,11,85193,12826,603,4428,824,14573,548,5203,281,20468,4458,1624,19076,16599,6960,13,59602,998,65054,11,1208,610,21493,5808,4502,1239,713,6723,43026,3575,72,13,7695,34670,5481,10205,15587,2047,4298,72427,25,824,45674,42738,6723,17780,26653,682,6,540,64722,653,1422,53979,3091,74756,1994,6723,23536,96536,11,48027,23536,24169,277,15363,87770,2749,460,13,7695,636,59029,1913,24439,304,5203,1156,266,8083,390,514,64346,648,1624,7638,53501,993,57946,13,11842,2586,272,318,301,822,36897,11,7643,2586,10532,59348,2773,336,11015,13,46962,73829,17459,3370,3900,2531,46245,18922,6697,1018,998,390,5203,13552,64,75697,4859,25,56511,11,2523,91075,5048,11,3067,2807,1104,548,2092,83,13873,60294,17751,385,917,540,8376,4428,13],"tokens":["447572","616e7465","20696c","2074726173","6c6f","636f","2064656c6c61","2073616c61","2070726f7665","20c3a8","207269","617070","6172","736f","20756e","206c6567","67696f","20636f6e","20756e61","2067","616d6261","207069c3b9","20636f7274","61","2e","20547574","7469","206c6f","20726963","6f7264","6176","616e6f","20696e7374","6162696c65","2c","206e657373","756e6f","207361","7065","7661","2