,"ory"," iz","y"," ;"," ny"," Ant","ark","t","ika"," iz","ao"," o","hat","ra"," dia"," tan","im","aty"," mang","ats","i","aka","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Ny tanimaty dia midika toerana na velarana tsy mamoka-javatra, noho ny taniny tsy afaka ambolena voninkazo, na noho ny hakely ny ranonorana (latsaky ny 250 mm isan-taona).\nNy tanimaty dia fantatra amin'ny endriny tsy misy zavamaniry firy amin'ny velarana lehibe. Ny tanimaty dia any ivelan'ny toerana ipetrahana sy ambolen'ny olombelona.\nTanimaty vovoka sy vato\n\nAo amin'ny tanimaty misy vovoka sy vato dia azo lazaina :\n- Ny tanimatin'i Sahara, any Afrika avaratra,\n- Ny tanimatin'i Sahel, ao atsimon'ny tanimatin'i Sahara\n- Ny tanimatin'i Gobi, any Azia atsinanana, any Mongolia sy any avaratry ny Sina\n- Ny tanimatin'i Mojave, any Kalifornia, any Etazonia\n- Ny tanimatin'i Namib, any Namibia any atsimon' Afrika\n- Ny tanimatin'i Kalahari, ao Botswana any atsimon' Afrika.\n- Ny tanimatin'i Taklamakan\n- Ny tanimatin'i Atacama\n- Ny Lohasahan'ny Faty (Death Valley)\nNy tanimaty dia toerana mety tsy misy biby na olona. Tsy voatery ho mafana akory izy ; ny Antarktika izao ohatra dia tanimaty mangatsiaka.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-mi-0013","collection":"dataset/fineweb/mi.jsonl","text":"Ka Ngaro Te Taumaha I Te Kai Nutrisystem?\nTe nuinga pea, ae. He kai totoka te aukati i te kai, na ka ngaro te taumaha o a raatau mahere kai te nuinga o nga kai tuuturu tiro he pai ki te kai totika.\nKo te wero ka tae mai i muri i te paetae o to taumaha whaainga ka hiahia koe ki te hoki ki te kai i waho, te whakarite i o kai, ki te kai kai tuuturu ranei. Ko nga kaitautohe o te kai e kii ana i te wa o te hotaka, kaore koe e akohia me pehea te hoko taonga, te hanga, me te whakarite i nga kai totika pai. Ma te punaha tuku kai e mahi katoa maau.\nMe whakamatau au i te Nutrisystem Diet?\nMena kei te hiahia koe ki te whakaheke i te taumaha, kaore koe e aro ki te kai kai takai me te kai whakatotoka, ana kaore he nui o te waa ki te tunu kai me te whakareri i a koe ake kai, katahi ka hiahia pea koe ki te tirotiro i tenei huarahi poto.\nMena he pai ki a koe te kai i nga whenua maha, kaare e taea te whai i te Nutrisystem.\nE hia nga utu mo te Nutrisystem me pehea te mahi?\nKo te kaupapa $ 300 mo te marama o te kai.","token_ids":[84068,452,12440,78,2722,24172,372,13856,358,2722,51710,18878,6091,615,5380,6777,308,7623,64,98763,11,42956,13,1283,597,2192,2458,31866,1028,264,3178,9491,602,1028,597,2192,11,4415,16909,7933,17606,1028,9637,372,13856,297,264,15473,460,84,44316,486,597,2192,1028,308,7623,64,297,94246,597,2192,9964,332,21585,259,8869,568,61700,20548,1028,597,2192,2458,11755,627,42,78,1028,289,2382,16909,259,6043,17154,602,296,6198,602,1028,7251,1955,68,297,311,9637,372,13856,421,5418,287,64,16909,305,19870,689,597,4748,20548,1028,305,39291,20548,1028,597,2192,602,289,29682,11,1028,421,587,277,635,602,297,597,2192,11,20548,1028,597,2192,597,2192,9964,332,21585,436,2194,72,13,30417,94246,597,1339,3989,383,297,1028,597,2192,384,597,3893,41390,602,1028,10667,297,1028,4106,13637,11,16909,461,597,4748,384,17774,2319,689,757,1069,41033,1028,305,28342,9637,95024,11,1028,15020,64,11,757,1028,421,587,277,635,602,94246,597,2192,2458,11755,61700,13,11583,1028,8474,13856,259,36834,597,2192,384,44316,72,597,4428,64,7643,2933,627,7979,421,587,309,460,84,8065,602,1028,18878,6091,615,27304,5380,44,7304,2004,72,1028,305,19870,689,597,4748,20548,1028,421,13637,383,441,602,1028,9637,372,13856,11,16909,461,597,4748,384,264,299,20548,1028,597,2192,597,2192,18608,2192,757,1028,597,2192,421,587,266,354,31866,11,41390,16909,461,568,308,2005,297,1028,289,5418,20548,1028,11716,84,597,2192,757,1028,421,587,277,31803,602,264,597,4748,264,441,597,2192,11,62788,6151,16909,305,19870,689,98763,597,4748,20548,1028,9165,4744,8869,602,259,1994,72,305,19253,52206,281,2117,627,44,7304,568,61700,20