","ero"," ka"," t","ae"," mai"," i"," m","uri"," i"," te"," pa","eta","e"," o"," to"," ta","um","aha"," wh","aa","ing","a"," ka"," h","iah","ia"," k","oe"," ki"," te"," h","oki"," ki"," te"," k","ai"," i"," w","aho",","," te"," wh","ak","ar","ite"," i"," o"," k","ai",","," ki"," te"," k","ai"," k","ai"," tu","ut","uru"," r","ane","i","."," Ko"," nga"," k","ait","auto","he"," o"," te"," k","ai"," e"," k","ii"," ana"," i"," te"," wa"," o"," te"," hot","aka",","," ka","ore"," k","oe"," e"," ak","oh","ia"," me"," pe","hea"," te"," h","oko"," ta","onga",","," te"," hang","a",","," me"," te"," wh","ak","ar","ite"," i"," nga"," k","ai"," tot","ika"," pai","."," Ma"," te"," pun","aha"," t","uku"," k","ai"," e"," mah","i"," k","ato","a"," ma","au",".\n","Me"," wh","ak","am","ata","u"," au"," i"," te"," Nut","ris","ystem"," Diet","?\n","M","ena"," ke","i"," te"," h","iah","ia"," k","oe"," ki"," te"," wh","aka","he","ke"," i"," te"," ta","um","aha",","," ka","ore"," k","oe"," e"," a","ro"," ki"," te"," k","ai"," k","ai"," tak","ai"," me"," te"," k","ai"," wh","ak","at","ot","oka",","," ana"," ka","ore"," he"," n","ui"," o"," te"," w","aa"," ki"," te"," tun","u"," k","ai"," me"," te"," wh","ak","ar","eri"," i"," a"," k","oe"," a","ke"," k","ai",","," kata","hi"," ka"," h","iah","ia"," pea"," k","oe"," ki"," te"," ti","rot","iro"," i"," t","ene","i"," h","uar","ahi"," p","oto",".\n","M","ena"," he"," pai"," ki"," a"," k","oe"," te"," k","ai"," i"," nga"," when","ua"," m","aha",","," ka","are"," e"," t","aea"," te"," wh","ai"," i"," te"," Nut","ris","ystem",".\n","E"," h","ia"," nga"," ut","u"," mo"," te"," Nut","ris","ystem"," me"," pe","hea"," te"," mah","i","?\n","K","o"," te"," ka","up","apa"," $"," ","300"," mo"," te"," m","aram","a"," o"," te"," k","ai","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Ka Ngaro Te Taumaha I Te Kai Nutrisystem?\nTe nuinga pea, ae. He kai totoka te aukati i te kai, na ka ngaro te taumaha o a raatau mahere kai te nuinga o nga kai tuuturu tiro he pai ki te kai totika.\nKo te wero ka tae mai i muri i te paetae o to taumaha whaainga ka hiahia koe ki te hoki ki te kai i waho, te whakarite i o kai, ki te kai kai tuuturu ranei. Ko nga kaitautohe o te kai e kii ana i te wa o te hotaka, kaore koe e akohia me pehea te hoko taonga, te hanga, me te whakarite i nga kai totika pai. Ma te punaha tuku kai e mahi katoa maau.\nMe whakamatau au i te Nutrisystem Diet?\nMena kei te hiahia koe ki te whakaheke i te taumaha, kaore koe e aro ki te kai kai takai me te kai whakatotoka, ana kaore he nui o te waa ki te tunu kai me te whakareri i a koe ake kai, katahi ka hiahia pea koe ki te tirotiro i tenei huarahi poto.\nMena he pai ki a koe te kai i nga whenua maha, kaare e taea te whai i te Nutrisystem.\nE hia nga utu mo te Nutrisystem me pehea te mahi?\nKo te kaupapa $ 300 mo te marama o te kai.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-mi-0004","collection":"dataset/fineweb/mi.jsonl","text":"Kei raro nei etahi o nga taputapu ka taea te whakamahi i te wahitau IP 192.168.11:\n- pouara\n- Kāmera Haumaru\n- Pūrere Rokiroki Whatunga (NAS)\n- Nga taputapu whatunga ahokore (whakauru, tukurua, aha atu)\nMe pehea te huri i te kupuhipa Wifi 192.168.1.1\nHei huri i te kupuhipa WiFi (kaore e pohehe ki te kupuhipa kaiwhakahaere pouara) me te wahitau IP 192.168.1.1 whai i enei mahi ngawari:\n- Whakatuwheratia he kaitirotiro paetukutuku ka patohia te wahitau IP 192.168.1.1 i te pae wāhitau.\n- Whakauruhia te ingoa o kaiwhakamahi me te kupuhipa ki te uru atu ki te paewhiri whirihoranga pouara.\n- Rapua he whiringa i te paewhiri whirihoranga o te pouara e pa ana ki te kupuhipa uru me te haumarutanga.\n- Whaia nga tohutohu i runga i te mata hei huri i te kupuhipa uru. (Ko te tikanga ka huri i runga i te waitohu o te pouara)\n- Tiakina nga huringa ka kati i te paewhiri whirihoranga pouara. Mai i tenei wa, ka hiahia koe ki te whakamahi i te kupuhipa hou hei uru atu ki te paewhiri whirihoranga o te pouara.","token_ids":[6746,72,436,17606,57097,1880,52206,297,94246,15596,332,391,84,16909,259,71435,1028,421,587,309,52206,602,1028,86327,275,2933,6933,220,5926,13,8953,13,806,512,12,17258,5169,198,12,735,31757,1195,64,14433,372,31244,198,12,393,54056,81,486,432,564,8869,6780,3639,92945,320,35596,340,12,452,6885,15596,332,391,84,1148,92945,23128,564,461,320,1336,587,4202,84,11,259,3178,324,4381,11,264,4317,520,84,340,7979,1069,41033,1028,305,6198,602,1028,81808,84,2200,64,60971,220,5926,13,8953,13,16,13,16,198,1548,72,305,6198,602,1028,81808,84,2200,64,34407,320,4657,461,384,3273,383,383,20548,1028,81808,84,2200,64,597,2192,1336,587,13856,486,17258,5169,8,757,1028,86327,275,2933,6933,220,5926,13,8953,13,16,13,16,421,2192,602,665,20568,44316,72,7933,675,2850,512,12,1254,587,36409,1336,261,266,689,568,597,1339,72,4744,8869,7251,295,3178,332,36834,16909,3352,2319,689,1028,86327,275,2933,6933,220,5926,13,8953,13,16,13,16,602,1028,281,6043,289,31757,23306,2933,627,12,1254,587,4202,12825,689,1028,6892,20103,297,597,2192,1336,587,309,52206,757,1028,81808,84,2200,64,20548,1028,4433,84,520,84,20548,1028,7251,365,71,21336,421,404,7141,269,19934,17258,5169,627,12,23097,4381,568,421,6322,64,602,1028,7251,365,71,21336,421,404,7141,269,19934,297,1028,17258,5169,384,7251,41390,20548,1028,81808,84,2200,64,4433,84,757,1028,6520,31967,332,19934,627,12,1254,64,689,94246,311,71,1564,17156,602,1629,6885,602,1028,97293,65589,305,6198,602,1028,81808,84,2200,64,4433,84,13,320,42,78,1028,87272,19934,16909,305,6198,602,1629,6885,602,1028,3868,2319,84,297,1028,17258,5169,340,12,23126,587,2259,94246,305,1711,64,16909,597,9491,602,1028,7251,365,71,21336,421,404,7141,269,19934,17258,5169,13,43356,602,259,1994,72,10667,11,16909,305,19870,689,597,4748,20548,1028,421,587,309,52206,602,1028,81808,84,2200,64,305,283,65589,4433,84,520,84,20548,1028,7251,365,71,21336,421,404,7141,269,19934,297,1028,17258,5169,13],"tokens":["4b65","69","2072","61726