asai, Zidane pansiun dari sipak bola internasional, namun katiko Parancih mangalami kasulikan untuak maluluihkan diri ka Piala Dunio 2006, Zidane mangumumkan pado Agustus 2005 bahwa inyo akan kambali bamain di tim nasional. Parancih akhirnyo luluih, tatapi Zidane nan baru malalui musim nan dipanuhi cedera di Madrid, mamutuihkan bahwa inyo akan mundua satalah Piala Dunia tasabuik salasai.\nPado tanggal 25 April 2006, Zizou sacaro rasmi mangumumkan kaputuihannyo untuak mundua dari klub jo tim nasional sipak bola Parancih satalah Piala Dunio 2006.\nPado tanggal 7 Mei 2006 Zizou mamainkan patandiangan tarakhir sabagai tuan rumah untuak Real Madrid di Stadion Santiago Bernabéu. Pamain Real Madrid mamakai baju kaus khusuo nan batando \"ZIDANE 2001 - 2006\" tatulih di bawah logo klub. Mode nan dapek didugo, pandukuang Real Madrid maagiah inyo sambuikan nan hangek jo mandukuang Zizou sapanjang patandiangan.","token_ids":[51,30827,220,1049,19,274,4306,1494,393,532,64,469,28657,220,1049,19,4371,300,2192,11,1901,307,2194,281,53167,359,25177,47715,587,98287,2655,300,4001,11,16854,359,45356,24551,4366,1149,7141,51296,278,10830,48756,360,23014,13365,84,587,8811,32748,71,8826,5534,72,16909,393,532,64,29838,822,220,1049,21,11,1901,307,2194,51296,372,372,8826,281,2172,4701,592,355,220,1049,20,78436,304,16417,33770,597,3042,8115,42404,467,1891,6935,17580,4001,13,4366,1149,7141,17774,30728,3919,78,326,32748,71,11,72813,2113,1901,307,2194,20622,69443,8811,278,2005,3167,318,20622,24522,276,84,6151,272,291,2473,1891,25048,11,33820,332,2005,71,8826,78436,304,16417,33770,41666,4381,274,4306,1494,393,532,64,29838,689,52314,370,84,1609,4371,300,2192,627,47,2172,92002,220,914,5936,220,1049,21,11,1901,450,283,11347,17606,51010,8318,51296,372,372,8826,45949,332,2005,71,13184,78,13365,84,587,41666,4381,25177,83790,7802,6935,17580,4001,47715,587,98287,4366,1149,7141,274,4306,1494,393,532,64,29838,822,220,1049,21,627,47,2172,92002,220,22,92033,220,1049,21,1901,450,283,33820,467,8826,3352,65674,191