t.jsonl","text":"Ta’ għoxrin sena s-surmast Muscat Azzopardi laħaq surmast direttur tal-banda ta’ l-Istitut ta’ San Ġużepp tal-Ħamrun. Fis-sena 1928, wara li ngħata bidu għat-twaqqif tal-banda San Ġużepp fi ħdan l-istitut ta’ San Ġuzepp f’Għajnsielem, is-surmast Anton Muscat Azzopardi, avviċinat minn Mons. Ġużeppi De Piro, aċċetta sabiex jgħallem il-mużika lit-tfal ta’ l-Orfanatrofju f’ Għawdex.\nBarra li kien għalliem tal-mużika kien ukoll għalliem tal-vuċi.\nHuwa għallem fl-iskola ta’ l-Imdina kif ukoll fil-Liċeo. Muscat Azzopardi, barra li kien ukoll surmast direttur ta’ diversi baned oħra Maltin, fosthom, il-banda Stella Maris Band Club ta’ tas-Sliema, li tagħha wkoll dan surmast direttur minn Marzu tas-sena 1938 sa’ l-1944.","token_ids":[57099,529,342,128,100,5241,26355,6252,64,274,1355,53470,561,5444,4719,362,10616,33029,72,1208,128,100,37406,1765,97613,13510,5683,324,8374,1481,10018,9637,529,326,22197,3781,332,9637,529,5960,10044,254,84,16020,604,8374,12,128,99,309,6236,13,435,285,1355,7304,220,5926,23,11,4208,64,908,7933,128,100,460,14435,84,342,128,100,266,2442,10196,28679,333,8374,1481,10018,5960,10044,254,84,16020,604,9314,10044,100,36255,326,12,380,275,332,9637,529,5960,10044,254,91311,604,282,529,38,128,100,1662,4511,648,3516,11,374,1355,53470,561,17958,5444,4719,362,10616,33029,72,11,1860,10176,128,233,258,266,1332,77,50601,13,10044,254,84,16020,604,72,1611,393,8869,11,264,128,233,128,233,27625,19972,72,327,503,70,128,100,278,3516,3900,1474,84,6077,11755,13318,2442,96688,9637,529,326,12,2244,31278,36436,69,8783,282,529,480,128,100,675,92869,627,3511,969,908,597,3675,342,128,100,543,27960,8374,1474,84,6077,11755,597,3675,15012,980,342,128,100,543,27960,8374,8437,84,128,233,72,627,82478,10196,342,128,100,278,3516,1344,12,3267,8083,9637,529,326,12,1453,67,2259,597,333,15012,980,1488,8288,72,128,233,25634,13,5444,4719,362,10616,33029,72,11,3703,969,908,597,3675,15012,980,1765,97613,13510,5683,324,9637,529,21797,72,9120,291,297,128,100,969,386,3223,258,11,3