-iáⁿ khì ak-tio̍h hō͘, soah khì tio̍h than-hong. Chiū-án-ne kui sin-khu bē-tín bē-tāng. Chhù-lāi ê sī-tōa chiok khī niau-á sí tī chhù-lāi, ài góa kā sàng cháu. Ko͘-put-jî-chiong, góa chí-hó kā A-Mi an-tah tī hù-kīn ê tek-nâ piⁿ. Ta̍k-kang khì kā chhī.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-nan-0045","collection":"dataset/fineweb/nan.jsonl","text":"Ū chı̍t àm goe̍h àm-mı̂, in saⁿ ê chhoā chhut-khı̀ Sài-hoa-lâu, khı̀ kap lâng chheng-siàu sǹg hoa-tāi , chiū-sı̄ sio̍k Bí-chu ê sin-kè, tı̄ hia soà hō͘ lâng chhiáⁿ. Thâu-ke chhiò gı̄-gı̄ pān chı̍t toh khiau-khiau, khó-sioh hit àm Khun-hong lio̍h-á kám-tio̍h bô sím-mı̍h káⁿ lim chiú, chiah lim nn̄g koàn Be̍h-á-chiú nā-tiāⁿ. Nā-sı̄ pêng-sı̂ chı̍t táⁿ bô lún--i, Ui-suh-kih, bu̍t-lân-tı̂ koàn-goā iā-sı̄ boē chùi, chheng-chiú lim-tit kúi-nā koàn. Nā-sı̄ nn̄g ê bó͘ tı̄ sin-piⁿ, koh sı̄ sǹg ū tio̍h siâⁿ-lāi ê bí-jı̂n, chiū kek án-ni khong-khong hō͘ nn̄g ê sè-ı̂-á chı̍t ê chhah chı̍t pêng iân-lō͘ sàn-pō͘ tò-lâi.","token_ids":[129,103,523,3862,136,235,83,3869,76,733,68,136,235,71,3869,76,1474,3862,136,224,11,304,829,53233,123,20183,523,6292,31757,523,71,332,12934,71,3862,97649,328,53651,2902,20103,2922,9011,84,11,24040,3862,97649,45949,326,9011,983,523,71,833,1355,72,6496,84,274,131,117,70,11640,64,2442,31757,72,1174,26883,54056,1355,3862,136,226,274,822,136,235,74,426,2483,11843,84,20183,7589,12934,4558,11,259,3862,136,226,305,689,779,6496,305,56761,137,246,326,9011,983,523,6151,1995,53233,123,13,666,9011,84,12,441,523,6151,22980,342,3862,136,226,12,70,3862,136,226,281,31757,77,523,3862,136,235,83,311,71,24040,689,84,12934,71,689,84,11,24040,1832,1355,822,71,4295,3869,76,20774,359,2902,647,326,822,136,235,71,12,1995,597,36334,2442,822,136,235,71,293,9769,45815,76,1474,3862,136,235,71,597,1995,53233,123,4671,26883,6792,11,523,19870,4671,11120,136,226,70,15593,89702,2893,136,235,71,12,1995,11843,72,6792,308,31757,2442,72,31757,53233,123,13,452,31757,1355,3862,136,226,281,5615,