tsen van een ander snoer verdween een deel van de hinder. Dat maakt de eerste waarneming niet onwaar, maar verandert wel de verklaring. In het verslag blijven beide stappen staan. Een ervaring is nuttiger wanneer een lezer kan zien onder welke omstandigheden zij ontstond dan wanneer ik alleen achteraf opschrijf of het product volgens mij goed of slecht was. Die twee woorden zouden hier bijna alles verbergen wat ik werkelijk heb uitgeprobeerd.","token_ids":[1951,61936,296,9425,22171,47501,304,54092,1450,11,32691,409,597,786,12704,830,305,3448,87908,409,10598,5355,9194,44402,13,763,8517,69439,301,73221,13665,3338,21454,40858,42250,3675,13,42433,1047,9194,917,5169,266,2537,84042,33936,14685,11,75260,409,1200,267,6427,38395,258,13665,9194,31331,451,44738,37533,627,53,10922,54092,44738,68991,3078,13667,42952,20894,69,13665,60447,316,409,8019,713,4504,665,409,597,16977,4529,2815,13665,59241,25290,713,3415,14685,13,42433,3980,830,48920,17797,336,1994,43200,53218,665,99553,48920,577,1220,80186,927,8859,71792,7404,1297,72723,71317,45897,13,1611,34923,351,374,387,716,74,466,25,30125,4809,74,13665,289,91585,13665,9194,305,360,5298,1810,301,18962,22011,44402,84754,30,13106,9194,2807,57638,1900,268,5355,8517,62905,66184,261,26742,1818,8517,409,301,5355,409,57780,13,22362,7643,10114,409,68670,10667,1923,74914,21454,389,10196,277,11,32691,2807,438,531,12724,409,2807,10784,3329,13,763,9194,5553,13667,74380,1055,98244,357,64860,29611,276,13,57518,72175,3329,374,10184,83,7420,289,91585,8517,514,7215,13728,80507,38861,12724,441,8019,2752,1108,14466,93014,14848,267,2159,9279,289,91585,13665,72273,87908,2642,1200,21740,20894,69,315,9194,2027,4499,59405,69497,47501,315,20328,14244,574,13,8574,73708,24670,28884,1167,68627,12694,23232,3458,37051,2807,655,4469,30125,13665,7205,18126,19275,59241,25290,713,53429,14685,13],"tokens":["4465","206e6965757765","206d","756973","206c6167","20676f6564","20696e","206d696a6e","2068616e64","2c","206d616172","206465","206b","6162656c","20626c65","6566","