h","eden"," zij"," ont","st","ond"," dan"," w","anneer"," ik"," alleen"," achter","af"," op","sch","rij","f"," of"," het"," product"," vol","gens"," mij"," goed"," of"," sle","cht"," was","."," Die"," twee"," wo","orden"," z","ouden"," hier"," bij","na"," alles"," ver","ber","gen"," wat"," ik"," wer","kel","ijk"," heb"," uit","ge","probe","erd","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"De nieuwe muis lag goed in mijn hand, maar de kabel bleef haken achter de rand van het bureau. In een winkel zou ik dat niet hebben gezien. Ik had het apparaat los geprobeerd, zonder de opstelling waarin ik het wilde gebruiken.\nVoor mijn gebruiksverslag beschrijf ik daarom de omgeving en de korte taken die ik heb uitgevoerd. Ik geef geen algemene rangorde en doe geen uitspraak over langdurige betrouwbaarheid. De vraag is beperkter: wat merk ik wanneer ik het hulpmiddel aan dit bureau gebruik? Na het verplaatsen van een ander snoer verdween een deel van de hinder. Dat maakt de eerste waarneming niet onwaar, maar verandert wel de verklaring. In het verslag blijven beide stappen staan. Een ervaring is nuttiger wanneer een lezer kan zien onder welke omstandigheden zij ontstond dan wanneer ik alleen achteraf opschrijf of het product volgens mij goed of slecht was. Die twee woorden zouden hier bijna alles verbergen wat ik werkelijk heb uitgeprobeerd.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ny-0005","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ny.jsonl","text":"Katundu wathu wavomerezedwa ndi ogulitsa katundu ambiri aku China, potipatsa mwayi wambiri wamabizinesi. Tikufuna kuthokoza wokonzekereratu potithandizira kuti titenge nawo mbali muchionetso kukhala chopambana.\nZambiri Zazaka zana zapitazo-Chifukwa cha OPI chiwonetsero chathu tidatha kupereka zithandizo zathu zambiri zakomwe kuli anthu ambiri ogulitsa katundu ku China. Pakadali pano, tinachititsanso msonkhano wopambana wa atolankhani ndipo timakhala okhutira kwambiri ndi kutsatsa komwe kwachitika kudzera mwambowu.\nLJ Hooker-Tachita nawo gawo la Overseas Property Immigration Investment Fair kwa zaka 3 zapitazi. Ichi ndiye chiwonetsero chabwino kwambiri chomwe tidachitapo nawo gawo ku China. Poyerekeza ndi zochitika zina zomwe tapitako, mtundu wa makasitomala okhala ndi zolinga zamphamvu zikuwoneka bwino pano. Ndife ofunitsitsa kufikira mgwirizano wamtundu wanthawi yayitali ndi okonza mu 2018.\n","token_ids":[78862,1263,84,289,589,84,54907,316,486,16284,10196,15953,72,7500,360,1220,64,45356,1263,84,9049,21336,87295,5734,11,3419,575,1900,64,296,3195,72,289,3042,21336,289,309,370,450,1572,72,13,73842,1739,8733,597,952,28342,4458,289,564,28143,52316,261,36409,3419,411,438,450,9008,31699,72,8305,6443,77016,78,10221,8115,1790,290,295,708,94377,71,6181,48094,3042,3444,627,57,3042,21336,1901,1394,13637,1167,3444,34078,275,41284,30653,333,3178,10196,13826,507,1932,26883,55767,295,805,78,523,589,84,13413,66826,81808,486,4657,1167,411,438,43994,1167,589,84,1167,3042,21336,51415,316,906,597,24520,23064,84,9049,21336,7500,360,1220,64,45356,1263,84,37700,5734,13,13662,329,8115,281,5770,11,25826,613,275,1220,598,78,296,942,31764,5770,289,454,3042,3444,10667,89755,1201,87911,15953,7088,6935,22506,6181,5509,71,332,9008,30625,3042,21336,15953,72,597,6256,1900,64,11129,906,30625,613,275,11755,597,664,89,2473,53910,3042,363,84,627,43,41,29271,261,9469,613,6388,77016,78,342,675,78,1208,86403,300,8825,40782,33350,14930,597,10196,1167,13637,220,18,34078,275,18291,13,358,14946,15953,72,9188,26883,55767,295,805,78,523,370,86,3394,30625,3042,21336,523,316,906,13413,613,275,66652,77016,78,342,675,78,37700,5734,13,393,2303,486,441,4458,15953,72,1167,5059,275,11755,1167,2259,1167,316,906,15596,275,29886,11,12232,1263,84,10667,52016,300,275,316,6181,5509,71,6181,15953,72,1167,85669,64,61576,764,309,46790,1167,39342,86,606,4657,35475,3394,281,5770,13,88468,1643,315,26726,1220,64,597,1739,1609,9008,14060,86,404,450,5770,289,363