,"collection":"dataset/fineweb/ny.jsonl","text":"Chokhumba chathu\nLolani Zhengcheng apite kudziko lapansi, dziko lidziwe Zhengcheng.\nMfundo yamakampani\nMgwirizano wokhazikika, wopambana-wopambana.\nLingaliro lautumiki\nPezani ulemu wamakasitomala ndi chidziwitso chaukadaulo komanso malingaliro antchito\nUdindo wa anthu\nNdi udindo wa kampani iliyonse kukhala ndi udindo pa chikhalidwe cha anthu.M'zaka zisanu ndi ziwiri zapitazi, Zhengcheng wakhala akutsatira filosofi yokhudzana ndi anthu komanso kuteteza chilengedwe.\nKwa ogwira ntchito\nLolani wogwira ntchito aliyense akhale ndi chidwi komanso kuchita bwino\nKugwira ntchito molimbika kwa membala aliyense wabanja la Zhengcheng kwathandizira kuti Zhengcheng achite bwino kwambiri masiku ano.Achibale amalemekezana, amaphunzira kuchokera kwa wina ndi mzake, amakula wina ndi mzake, amapita patsogolo pamodzi, ndipo nthawi zonse amalowetsa mphamvu zatsopano ku Zhengcheng.Ndimalo ogwirizana kotero kuti titha kupatsa makasitomala zinthu zapamwamba komanso ntchito zabwino kwambiri, ndikupangitsa Zhengcheng kukula bwino.","token_ids":[1163,564,71,71669,523,589,84,198,43,337,5676,77547,68284,1469,635,597,664,89,24551,24301,53167,11,26802,24551,27431,8510,906,77547,68284,627,44,69,13807,379,309,587,309,857,72,198,44,55233,404,450,5770,289,564,71,1394,1609,11755,11,289,454,3042,3444,2695,454,3042,3444,627,43,287,8115,299,94639,372,7723,198,47,10333,5676,577,3516,84,289,309,587,300,275,316,6181,15953,72,523,307,8510,89619,708,523,2933,74,2649,8938,11129,598,78,296,6260,8115,299,3276,331,6491,198,52,67,36099,10667,23064,84,198,45,8747,28092,36099,10667,34761,857,72,3900,16618,263,325,94377,71,6181,15953,72,28092,36099,7251,523,1609,12130,307,906,13826,23064,84,1345,6,89,13637,1167,17570,84,15953,72,1167,38181,21336,34078,275,18291,11,77547,68284,289,22506,6181,17774,6256,266,9008,1488,437,93123,90777,81488,89,3444,15953,72,23064,84,11129,598,78,31699,7870,4458,523,321,833,291,906,627,42,10196,7500,86,9008,32512,331,6491,198,43,33