"," Dak","k","ár"," č","á","h","ce","cross","ask","o","ht","era"," ii"," s","á","hte"," be","are"," man","nat"," rá","mb","uv","rr","as"," o","ast","it",","," le","a"," ol","u"," maid"," š","add","á"," dah","kat"," nu"," a","hte"," dat"," š","add","á"," bu","orre"," č","áz","is","."," D","asa"," mann","á"," ol","u"," á","igi"," ja"," f","erte"," maid"," má","ht","tu"," le","at"," das","a","."," Pol","aris"," le","a"," go","it"," h","ui"," ge","ah","pas"," vu","od","jit",","," dan"," le","a"," á","l","ki"," h","ál","let"," ja"," mu","đ","ui"," do","a","ib","m","á"," maid"," h","ui"," bu","res",","," mu","ital","a"," son","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Vaikko son lea ge Eurohpámeašttir, de sus eai leat hárjehallanvejolašvuođat. Eai goit Norggas, son šaddá gal vuolggahit skohtera riikarájá rastá.\n– Hárjehallat gal lean dušše oktii šaddan, go dáppe Norggas ii beasa hárjehallat. Mun láven šaddat gitta Heahttái vuodjit jus galggan hárjehallat, dán háve in leat ollen go oktii doppe fitnat, muitala son.\nIi sáhte beare rámbuvrras viežžalit\nLänsman vuoddjá Polaris Pro RMK 800 skohteriin. Son vujii ovdal Lynx, muhto lonuhii Polarisii moadde jagi dassái. Son lea aitto bijahan skohterii ođđa olggoža, sabehiid ja muđui ordnen skohtera nu ahte lea gilvogearggus. Dat lea gal vel nu ahte dakkár skohtera ii sáhte beare mannat viežžalit rámbuvrras.\n– Dakkár čáhcecrossaskohtera ii sáhte beare mannat rámbuvrras oastit, lea olu maid šaddá dahkat nu ahte dat šaddá buorre čázis. Dasa manná olu áigi ja ferte maid máhttu leat dasa. Polaris lea goit hui geahpas vuodjit, dan lea álki hállet ja muđui doaibmá maid hui bures, muitala son.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-se-0051","collection":"dataset/fineweb/se.jsonl","text":"Marit Hætta Øverli lea geahččaladdan iešguđet šáŋŋeriid ovdal go fuomášii ahte luođis son viežžá eanemus inspirašuvnna.\nSon lea mánnán leamaš mielde Máze Nieiddat joavkkus. Lávlon polkaluđiid, mars ja tango, ja gospellávluma. Progressiiva rockejoavku lea čuojahan suinna, popmusihka ovdanbuktán, bargan ovttas Norgga jazzmusihkkáriiguin ja mátkkoštan Amerihkás ja Kanadas.\n– Buot dán dagai son ovdal go fuomášii ahte háliidii ieš stivret iežas musihkalaš luotta ja gávdnat dan luotta mas son loaktá buoremusat, čállá suohkan.\nNanu komponistaduogáš\nKlemet Anders Buljo lea musihkkár ja buvttadeaddji. Son lea čuojahan ja searvan badjel 2000 lávlagii sihke gitárain dahje buvttadeaddjin.\nSon lea komponeren lávlagiid Norgga Opera, Lillehammer OG, Beaivváš Sámi Našunálateáhtera ja Deanu kulturskuvlla ovddas.\n– Son lea ollu sámi artisttaide leamaš musihkalaš jođiheaddjin ja jođihan orkeastariid, čállá Álttá suohkan ákkastallamis.","token_ids":[12331,275,473,9371,83,2629,90043,424,747,514,64,3980,1494,13453,13453,278,723,276,30958,11906,8890,52096,295,37524,1995,129,233,129,233,31803,307,297,17008,278,733,18922,316,1995,11906,3893,264,56599,326,24012,52096,285,4538,17536,12453,12453,1995,384,276,336,355,12979,64,11906,12328,77,3458,627,46714,514,64,29830,7521,11644,514,3105,11906,9686,301,451,386,1995,3059,53383,1810,266,7802,402,19747,355,13,445,1995,85,12490,1499,36641,84,52096,55583,11,48449,12203,259,5281,11,12203,342,4890,616,1995,14878,13722,13,16418,72,10126,7091,68,7453,402,12407,514,64,33902,84,21963,22826,924,258,3458,11,2477,38827,7141,4657,297,17008,276,65,38767,11644,11,26967,276,25568,5683,300,452,1813,6885,34997,38827,7141,19747,1995,462,27843,258,12203,29830,6375,9509,11906,53691,50873,7141,74,7206,12203,31663,11354,627,4235,28326,354,294,11644,29169,2192,4538,297,17008,278,733,18922,316,1995,11906,3893,264,56599,43222,747,307,3893,30958,11906,357,344,2171,30958,12453,300,3167,7141,74,6181,11906,25774,22983,12203,342,1995,17008,34397,9279,25774,22983,9427,4538,781,10114,1995,1048,13475,88532,11,33902,1995,657,1995,924,2319,8826,627,45,276,84,11129,621,380,329,84,540,1995,11906,198,42,3516,295,4