ý predseda domáceho oddielu Juraj Trsťan. Zápas mal však hladký priebeh a diváci videli veľmi kvalitné stretnutie. „V prvom polčase podali mužstvá vynikajúce výkony, ktoré sú hodné minimálne štvrtej ligy. Musím urobiť poklonu domácim aj hosťom za predvedený výkon. Hostia ukázali, že majú starší a veľmi kvalitný káder. V druhom polčase však rozhodca svojimi verdiktami pridal do zápasu nervozitu a vyvrcholilo to inzultáciou,“ dodal J. Trsťan. Na pozore sa museli mať aj hostia, ktorí mali šatne na druhej strane, a tak nič nevideli.","token_ids":[57,8875,84,1794,2479,1167,548,70,15931,838,951,64,75901,264,12453,294,16023,7206,75901,3512,1995,52767,11,597,11222,2483,348,30998,747,4415,523,17278,84,264,304,89,495,13825,72,938,24752,347,20811,11,2118,281,5047,278,4415,18448,92110,83642,13005,20195,61821,14151,4824,1995,346,6292,10535,13327,84,39898,1662,1183,82,75901,276,13,1901,1995,42201,8811,348,11906,587,305,18599,74,20195,281,7379,30998,264,3512,1995,5979,18619,12574,5320,128,122,8318,597,838,275,52235,5527,1546,332,648,13,15179,53,85988,316,1499,13453,521,7661,8115,12097,12453,267,85,1995,348,1910,1609,1662,6792,346,348,20195,74,3633,11,597,11222,978,274,6792,87903,52235,21877,19540,818,37524,83,19456,668,73,29413,88,13,5444,56094,577,299,8385,75901,45295,12490,84,4824,30441,318,26514,68927,75901,316,15036,4255,2111,268,20195,348,20195,40637,13,16492,689,15012,60921,8115,11,85874,24906,6792,6917,89950,264,5320,128,122,8318,597,838,275,77,20195,597,1995,1126,13,650,1377,12825,316,1499,13453,521,348,11906,587,938,24752,347,936,67107,73,25877,26742,32680,10830,550,26966,656,1167,1995,42201,84,20233,9700,33462,264,46359,19456,331,337,18536,311,304,89,495,1995,5979,283,11,2118,32189,278,622,13,1183,82,75901,276,13,13106,41821,461,829,3167,12574,7643,75901,26514,3552,689,11,597,11222,2483,296,8115,37524,266,818,4415,1377,92647,73,610,2194,11,264,18608,13080,13453,841,1325,12574,13],"tokens":["5a","72617a","75","20736f6d","206c656e","207a","617265","67","697374726f","76616c