t","u"," in"," de","kol","te","ja"," s"," k","onic","ami"," pr","st","ov"," ali"," bl","az","in","ico"," v","ate","."," Z"," ne","ž","n","imi"," pr","it","isk","i"," vt","ir","aj","te"," v"," s","mer","i"," od"," br","ade"," prot","i"," č","elu","."," Up","or","ab","lj","aj","te"," z","j","ut","raj"," in"," z","ve","č","er"," o","zi","roma"," ved","no",","," ko"," va","š","a"," ko","ž","a"," pot","re","bu","je"," os","ve","ž","ite","v"," in"," dod","ate","k"," vl","age","."," Iz","de","lek"," je"," nar","avn","ega"," iz","v","ora",","," z","ato"," lah","ko"," med"," pos","ame","zn","imi"," ser","ij","ami"," pride"," do"," mal","enk","ost","ih"," raz","lik"," pri"," bar","vi"," in"," k","ons","ist","enci","."," Iz","de","lek"," pred"," nan","os","om"," r","ah","lo"," pret","res","ite","."," Sh","ran","ju","j","te"," v"," tem","n","em"," in"," su","hem"," prost","oru"," pri"," sob","ni"," temper","atur","i",".\n","N","as","vet"," #","1",":\n","Es","enco"," n","anes","ite"," na"," ob","raz"," s"," cel","ot","no"," pov","r","š","ino"," dl","ani",","," z"," ne","ž","n","imi"," pr","it","isk","i",","," sa","j"," na"," ta"," na","č","in"," ust","var","j","ate"," ne","ž","ni"," vak","um",","," ki"," del","uje"," na"," š","e"," bol","j","š","o"," absor","pc","ijo"," iz","del","ka",".\n","N","as","vet"," #","2",":\n","Po"," nan","os","u"," po","č","ak","aj","te"," ne","k","aj"," tren","ut","kov",","," da"," se"," iz","de","lek"," pop","ol","n","oma"," v","pi","je"," in"," š","ele"," n","ato"," nad","al","ju","j","te"," z"," neg","o",".\n","N","as","vet"," #","3",":\n","Es","enco"," lah","ko"," n","anes","ete"," t","udi"," kad","ark","oli"," sk","o","zi"," dan",","," da"," zag","ot","ov","ite"," pop","ol","no"," nav","la","ž","en","ost"," in"," sve","ž"," iz","g","led","."],"ids_available":true,"boundaries_approximate":false,"piece_format":"hex_bytes","decoded_text":"Formulacija je obogatena z izvlečkom vrtnice in geranije.\nDermatološko testirano\nDokazano navlaži kožo.\nBrez vsebnosti THC-ja.\nStanje kože:\nVlažilna esenca za obraz je namenjena prav vsem tipom kože.\nUstvarjena je z namenom, da kožo intenzivno odžeja, napne in prebudi.\nKožna stanja: dehidrirana, izsušena in pusta koža, ki je izgubila prožnost in mehkobo.\nFormulacija ciljno deluje tudi na poenotenje polti.\nUporaba:\nNanesite na očiščeno kožo obraza, vratu in dekolteja s konicami prstov ali blazinico vate. Z nežnimi pritiski vtirajte v smeri od brade proti čelu. Uporabljajte zjutraj in zvečer oziroma vedno, ko vaša koža potrebuje osvežitev in dodatek vlage. Izdelek je naravnega izvora, zato lahko med posameznimi serijami pride do malenkostih razlik pri barvi in konsistenci. Izdelek pred nanosom rahlo pretresite. Shranjujte v temnem in suhem prostoru pri sobni temperaturi.\nNasvet #1:\nEsenco nanesite na obraz s celotno površino dlani, z nežnimi pritiski, saj na ta način ustvarjate nežni vakum, ki deluje na še boljšo absorpcijo izdelka.\nNasvet #2:\nPo nanosu počakajte nekaj trenutkov, da se izdelek popolnoma vpije in šele nato nadaljujte z nego.\nNasvet #3:\nEsenco lahko nanesete tudi kadarkoli skozi dan, da zagotovite popolno navlaženost in svež izgled.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-sm-0080","collection":"dataset/fineweb/sm.jsonl","text":"E lua vaega sa vaevaeina iai lea tauvaga, o le po sa faia ai siva fa’aleTusiPa’ia ma Fa’aEvagelia fa’apea tauvaga-pese.\nNa manumalo ‘Aiga Pa’ia i vaega uma ia ma latou maua ai le fa’ailoga o le siamupini aoao.\nNa saunoa le Afioga a le Ali’i Patele o Losi Numia, o le tauvaga lea e le o se tausinioga po’o ai e sili, a’o le a’oa’o ma malamalama lelei i a’afiaga o fuala’au-fa’asaina ma le pule i le ola, i aiga, ekalesia ma le atunu’u aoao.\n“O lo’o tatou talanoa i le taua o le leai atu i nei vaega uma, fuala’au-fa’asaina ma le pule i le ola,” o lana fa’aaliga lea.\n“O se ‘auala e momoli atu ai le fe’au mo tupulaga talavou ae maise le fa’ailoa atu i tupulaga, e le o le pule i le ola le tali o a tatou fa’afitauli, “O lo’o to’atele tagata, le mamalu o le atunu’u e aofia ai ma tatou uma, e mafai ona fa’asoa iai pe a mo’omia se fesoasoani…ae aupito taua ai, ‘aua ne’i galo le tatalo.","token_ids":[36,20980,11412,11437,829,11412,5230,6043,2259,602,2192,514,64,32923,85,12748,11,297,514,3273,829,2267,689,16796,274,10126,2267,529,1604,51,53913,20908,529,689,7643,18145,40753,35212,351,37029,2267,529,2070,64,32923,85,12748,2320,2423,627,16589,893,372,12812,3451,32,16960,16056,529,689,602,11412,11437,10832,35924,7643,6987,283,60014,64,16796,514,2267,529,607,14361,297,514,4502,309,455,6729,15190,3524,627,16589,829,16711,64,514,362,10188,14361,264,514,14925,529,72,393,349,273,297,9853,72,16610,689,11,297,514,32923,85,12748,514,64,384,514,297,513,9637,355,6729,14361,3273,529,78,16796,384,274,4008,11,264,529,78,514,264,529,20103,529,78,7643,8811,309,278,3105,514,63885,602,264,529,47010,12748,297,282,71220,529,2933,2269,64,529,300,73722,7643,514,281,1130,602,514,297,4355,11,602,264,16960,11,27955,3916,689,7643,514,520,63353,529,84,15190,3524,627,2118,46,781,529,78,72813,283,8374,5770,64,602,514,32923,64,297,514,514,2192,520,84,602,57097,11412,11437,10832,11,282,71220,529,2933,2269,64,529,300,73722,7643,514,281,1130,602,514,297,4355,2476,297,326,3444,2267,40753,278,16960,514,64,627,2118,46,513,3451,64,71220,384,3450,14559,520,84,16796,514,1172,529,2933,4647,58485,360,12748,8374,402,283,42956,296,4105,514,2267,529,607,20103,520,84,602,58485,360,12748,11,384,514,297,514,281,1130,602,514,297,4355,514,259,8115,297,264,72813,283,2267,529,2642,275,5049,72,11,1054,46,781,529,78,311,529,349,273,4877,460,11,514,33820,38086,297,514,520,63353,529,84,384,264,1073,689,16796,7643,72813,283,10832,11,384,296,2642,2192,389,64,2267,529,300,20103,602,2192,1069,264,4647,529,316,689,513,282,29930,40055,5676,1981,6043,98544,6491,32923,64,16796,11,3451,2933,64,841,529,72,342,12812,514,259,4306,78,13],"tokens":["45","206c7561","207661","656761","207361","207661","6576","61