haringan e etsa hore o fete matla. U ka etsisa Jutsus, ua etsa likhopolo-taba, malakabe a tukang matsatsi a 7, a etsa avatar e kholo e u sireletsang le ho u loanela le ho lihela li-meteor.\nBaetsi bohle ba ho qetela e ne e le Uchiha. Ke Naruto feela ea nang le Sage of Six Paths le limpho tseo a li fumaneng bakeng sa libata tse ling tse mohatla tse ka tšoanang le tsona.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-st-0025","collection":"dataset/fineweb/st.jsonl","text":"Ka 1964, Bill Shankly, setšoantšo se tummeng ka ho fetisisa historing ea sehlopha sa Liverpool, o ile a etsa qeto e neng e tla fetola maikutlo a Liverpool ka ho sa feleng, ho hlahisa setlolo se sefubelu se feletseng, ka lebaka la hore se ne se tla fa sehlopha sa hae moeli oa kelello.Lekhetlo la pele ha e ne e aparoa Anfield o ile a re \"ho ne ho e-na le khanya e kang mollo o tukang.\"Taba ea kelello e ne e jere khopolo ea hore moroallo o mofubelu o ne o tla bolela 'matla le kotsi'.\nKe ho tsoa qetong ena moo Nike a ileng a nka khothatso ea boqapi ha a rala lisebelisoa tsa Liverpool bakeng sa sehla sa 21/22, ka kit e khubelu e felletseng e emelang matla, e babatsoang ke ente ea matla - 'khanya' - ka sebopeho sa Bright Crimson.","token_ids":[84068,220,5162,19,11,8766,83910,398,11,743,11906,78,519,11906,78,513,15756,76,833,16909,11640,16872,9667,64,7135,287,37646,92765,385,4055,829,25715,11,297,31905,264,220,1441,64,2874,11269,384,308,833,384,259,4355,16872,8083,7643,90094,385,264,25715,16909,11640,829,18515,833,11,11640,305,15342,10994,743,75,10216,513,513,69,392,79378,513,1172,10145,833,11,16909,514,65,13637,1208,305,461,513,841,513,259,4355,2267,92765,385,4055,829,305,6043,4647,12574,91912,2004,273,75,385,1236,1247,14122,385,1208,1069,273,6520,384,841,384,1469,17606,64,1556,2630,297,31905,264,312,330,6292,841,11640,384,94182,514,24040,25041,384,99386,22337,385,297,259,3178,526,1210,8750,64,37646,2004,273,75,385,384,841,384,503,486,24040,454,10216,3764