,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"fineweb-ty-0017","collection":"dataset/fineweb/ty.jsonl","text":"E aravihi mai teie taata poro apî ia hi‘o o ’na e nafea te taata poro aravihi e haapii ai i te tahi atu a na reira atoa ’tu ai. (Luka 6:40) E eita o ’na e taiâ ia ite o ’na e e tauturuhia o ’na. Mea maitai atoa ia haapopou ia ’na e ia horoa ’tu i te tahi mau mana‘o tauturu.—Koh. 4:9, 10.\nA TAUAPARAU E TO OE HOA PORORAA\nI te tahi râ mau mahana, noa ’tu ta tatou mau tutavaraa atoa, na to tatou hoa pororaa te mau tauaparauraa maitai a‘e. A haamana‘o e ua tono “tatoopiti” Iesu i ta ’na mau pǐpǐ no te poro. (Luka 10:1) A ohipa amui ai, ua faaitoito ratou te tahi i te tahi. E taime maitai mau te ohiparaa e to tatou mau taeae e tuahine i roto i te taviniraa no te “mahanahana,” aore ra faaitoito, te tahi i te tahi.—Roma 1:12.\nEaha ta orua e nehenehe e paraparau? Ua ite anei hoê o orua i te hoê tupuraa faaitoito mau? Ua ite mai anei oe i te hoê haapiiraa anaanatae mau i roto i ta oe iho haapiiraa aore ra i ta outou haapiiraa utuafare?","token_ids":[36,802,6321,6151,17154,1028,648,9637,460,4247,78,1469,25108,35924,15960,14336,78,297,18217,3458,384,4415,95314,1028,9637,460,4247,78,802,6321,6151,384,6520,2113,72,16796,602,1028,259,52206,520,84,264,4415,312,9008,520,20103,18217,25506,16796,13,320,43,26261,220,21,25,1272,8,469,384,6388,297,18217,3458,384,53637,9011,35924,433,68,297,18217,3458,384,384,259,2784,324,12825,689,297,18217,3458,13,2206,64,296,1339,2192,520,20103,35924,6520,391,454,283,35924,18217,3458,384,35924,4917,20103,18217,25506,602,1028,259,52206,60014,31231,14336,78,259,2784,21585,35192,42,2319,13,220,19,25,24,11,220,605,627,32,350,36128,2599,946,36128,469,5257,56630,31350,32,58970,878,6157,198,40,1028,259,52206,436,9011,60014,44316,3444,11,912,64,18217,25506,9637,72813,283,60014,18551,402,5169,64,520,20103,11,4415,311,72813,283,11640,64,4247,269,5418,1028,60014,32923,391,277,4202,5418,296,1339,2192,264,14336,68,13,362,6520,309,3444,143