te puai no te auraro ia ’na ma te taiva ore? E mana‘o anei oe e ua riro teie tupuraa ei taime no te haafatata ’tu ia Iehova?\n15. No te aha Adamu i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova?\n15 E faaau ana‘e te reira i ta te taata matamua ra o Adamu i rave. Ua tiaturi anei oia e e nehenehe oia e faaroo ore ia Iehova e e ora noa? Aita, “e ere hoi Adamu tei vare.” (Tim. 1, 2:14) No te aha ïa oia i faaroo ore ai ia Iehova? Ua amu Adamu i te maa hotu ta ta ’na vahine i horoa ’tu no te mea ua here rahi a‘e oia i ta ’na vahine i ia Iehova.","token_ids":[975,13,469,4415,95314,358,2701,12949,384,259,2784,21585,16796,35924,69483,35924,9165,37332,12825,689,11640,5615,10804,78,297,1028,8791,84,2642,548,5380,975,362,18728,6198,4415,602,1028,259,52206,520,84,58485,90595,11375,72,13,393,1994,689,14336,68,46659,9165,37332,12825,689,11640,5615,10804,78,297,311,69483,8791,84,2642,548,13,549,64,433,68,69483,384,13856,9637,1028,30545,25045,384,1370,2933,15473,912,308,689,602,1028,1172,689,1028,72,9165,37332,12825,689,13,320,42,269,13,220,16,11,220,20,25,806,26,358,20103,13,220,17,11,220,605,8,2360,311,69483,1618,602,2024,64,9637,460,11,384,31231,14336,78,281,13856,69483,384,757,64,11375,72,60014,35924,44521,17606,602,1028,2267,2933,2473,64,30545,25045,264,461,15473,384,6388,938,64,18217,25506,384,69553,1994,383,13,469,9165,2693,72,459,20568,69483,384,384,4917,20103,17154,311,69483,6344,4381,602,1028,15473,14336,72,602,1028,18757,2192,912,1028,44521,17606,35924,18217,3458,7643,1028,9637,10126,16536,30,469,31231,14336,78,459,20568,69483,384,46659,436,8869,1028,648,58485,90595,30529,9637,547,912,1028,6520,2642,266,460,18217,25506,35924,358,2701,12949,5380,868,13,2360,1028,264,4317,15387,84,602,2267,76865,16536,16796,35924,358,2701,12949,5380,868,469,2267,64,2933,41390,14336,68,1028,312,9008,602,9637,1028,9637,460,5634,309,4381,15473,297,15387,84,602,91503,13,549,64,9165,2693,72,459,20568,297,689,384,384,69553,1994,383,297,689,384,2267,76865,16536,35924,358,2701,12949,384,384,60425,912,64,30,362,6388,11,1