ha inqwaba yentsha emnyama ukujoyina lo mdlalo,” kubeka uNgubane oqale ukuzibandakanya ne-hockey ngo-1993.\nLesi sikhulu siveze nokuthi basaba ukuthi neligi ye-outdoor, okumele iqale ngo-Ephreli iphele ngoSepthemba ngeke iqale ngesikhathi ngenxa yeCoronavirus.\nUNgubane uveze ukuthi nakuba zikhona izingqinamba kulo mdlalo ezifana nobandlululo kodwa weneme ngosekuzuzwe i-INK Hockey Club eyasungulelwa ukusiza izingane zaseNanda, Ntuzuma neKwaMashu.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"news-en-0010","collection":"dataset/news/en.jsonl","text":"A repair to a bridge has brought an unexpected archive to light\n\nWorkers inspecting a footbridge in the town of Low Ash found a sealed metal box containing maintenance notes and photographs of earlier repairs.\n\nThe papers were placed there by a previous works team, apparently to help whoever came next. Some drawings record changes that do not appear in the council's surviving plans.\n\nEngineers are checking the notes against the structure rather than assuming they are accurate. A pencilled annotation, for example, describes a proposed alteration without confirming that it was built.\n\nThe discovery will not delay the current safety work. Conservators have photographed the contents, and the originals will be stored away from the damp bridge.\n\nWhen the repair is finished, the council plans to put a new set of records in its ordinary archive, with a reference attached to the bridge. Officials say finding useful documents should not depend on opening the right panel by chance.","token_ids":[32,13023,311,264,14497,706,7263,459,16907,18624,311,3177,271,75586,25052,287,264,4579,14024,304,279,6424,315,12310,14937,1766,264,19584,9501,3830,8649,13709,8554,323,25232,315,6931,31286,382,791,16064,1051,9277,1070,555,264,3766,4375,2128,11,14132,311,1520,39371,3782,1828,13,4427,38940,3335,4442,430,656,539,5101,304,279,15177,596,40746,6787,382,4674,388,527,13598,279,8554,2403,279,6070,485