play of household objects is being rewritten. Labels that once said only “maker unknown” now explain what researchers have checked and what evidence is missing.\n\nOne wooden box carries a workshop mark, but no surviving record links it to a named craftsperson. Rather than guess, the museum shows a photograph of the mark and invites comparisons with other collections.\n\nCurators say visitors often interpreted the old wording as a final conclusion. The new labels make clear that uncertainty can be the starting point of an investigation.\n\nNot every suggestion will alter the catalogue. Submissions will be assessed, and proposed changes will remain separate from confirmed information.\n\nThe museum has also retained copies of previous labels. Staff say that recording how an interpretation changes is part of looking after an object, even when the earlier explanation now seems incomplete.","measurement_context":null,"character_measurement":null,"roundtrip_exact":true},{"id":"news-ja-0019","collection":"dataset/news/ja.jsonl","text":"陶器の笛で鳥を呼ばず　自然観察会が演奏場所を変更\n\n【サリオ湖】サリオ湖で開かれた陶器市は、鳥の鳴き声に似た笛の試奏場所を、湖畔から町の広場へ移した。繁殖期の鳥への影響を避けるためだ。\n\n職人は水の量で音が変わる笛を並べ、客に仕組みを説明した。湖の観察会では笛を使わず、案内人が記録した音を屋内で聞く形にした。\n\n例年は湖畔で自由に吹けたため、変更を知らずに訪れた人もいた。主催者は販売時に案内を添え、現地の看板も増やしたという。\n\n自然保護団体は、すべての音が直ちに害になると断定しているわけではないと説明する。影響を詳しく測るのが難しい時期には、避けられる刺激を減らす考えだ。職人たちは「音を楽しむ場所まで含めて、使い方を伝えたい」と話した。","token_ids":[14309,114,32648,16144,17925,249,16556,165,111,98,30512,17857,120,81219,2243,248,23249,37026,61994,25038,111,15973,253,38093,29295,78256,242,28194,237,75267,32938,30512,8192,231,34226,271,11144,60868,37823,90962,85300,244,11199,60868,37823,90962,85300,244,16556,87447,32149,33121,28713,14309,114,32648,23530,15682,5486,165,111,98,16144,165,111,112,50834,71174,20230,17885,120,28713,17925,249,16144,50520,99,28194,237,75267,32938,30512,5486,85300,244,40198,242,55031,7518,118,16144,11795,225,75267,2243,116,60634,56051,1811,163,117,223,36149,244,23538,16144,165,111,98,2243,116,16144,58322,165,253,123,30512,30